(Sequence to prepare a schedule_candidate for dispatch_ready via compliance path:)
(1. create_candidate ?c)
(2. allocate_vehicle_unit ?c ?v)
(3. attach_task_profile ?c ?rtp)
(4. confirm_candidate_preparedness ?c ?rtp)
(5. assign_operator_resource ?c ?op)
(6. assign_skill_certificate ?c ?skill)
(7. assign_compliance_certificate ?c ?comp)
(8. apply_operational_constraint ?c ?oc ?rtp)
(9. confirm_operator_alignment ?c ?op)
(10. verify_compliance_certificate ?c ?comp)
(11. finalize_candidate_after_compliance_validation ?c  (makes dispatch_ready and candidate_finalized))
(12. allocate_dispatch_slot_for_candidate ?c ?dispatch_slot ?rtp)
(13. execute_schedule_dispatch ?c ?v ?dispatch_slot)
(After step 13, vehicle and dispatch slot become available again.)
(We could release operator, skill, compliance after use if needed elsewhere.)
